                                "sense_id": "78515c9c-aaee-3dc9-a289-08716ce2c1e4",
                                "text": "The overbow formers are then lowered out of the net contour, exposing fixed net contour ( inner mold line ) formers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
